            "text": "Injection / unsafe patterns (opengrep taint + ast-grep structural) — No issue identified: Python sources (shell_client.py, interactive.py, demo.py, coding_workflow.py, config.py)\n\nopengrep full ruleset (--config /opt/opengrep-rules --taint-intrafile, 617 rules): 0 findings. ast-grep structural pass over the 5 files confirms the only shell-string construction sites are the intended /bin/bash -c wrappers (shell.run), including the task-ID interpolation in coding_workflow.py already captured in the threat model as an operator-input command-injection caveat. No secrets, no eval/exec, no SQL, no path traversal sinks."
